{"5295370":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Baukiste","steam_appid":5295370,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5295410],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You build the plant. Your program makes it run.<\/h2>Baukiste is a training ground for PLC programming. You put conveyors, motors and sensors together into a plant and write the program that moves it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Programming<\/h2>In the built-in training PLC (ST\/SCL) or with CODESYS.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A handbook guides you<\/h2>Step by step to your first own program.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access<\/h2>Everything described on this page is in the game.<br><br>We are open to your ideas: new models, devices, connections or improvements to the handbook. <br>We build what fits into the game. That is exactly why Baukiste is in Early Access: so it gets better the way you want it.<br><strong>Language:<\/strong> German and English.","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You build the plant. Your program makes it run.<\/h2>Baukiste is a training ground for PLC programming. You put conveyors, motors and sensors together into a plant and write the program that moves it.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Programming<\/h2>In the built-in training PLC (ST\/SCL) or with CODESYS.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A handbook guides you<\/h2>Step by step to your first own program.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access<\/h2>Everything described on this page is in the game.<br><br>We are open to your ideas: new models, devices, connections or improvements to the handbook. <br>We build what fits into the game. That is exactly why Baukiste is in Early Access: so it gets better the way you want it.<br><strong>Language:<\/strong> German and English.","short_description":"Build conveyor plants and run them with your own PLC program, in the built-in training PLC or with CODESYS.","supported_languages":"English, German","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5295370\/dafe7ff5c5960f84f30cc974d1fb2a6693c13388\/header.jpg?t=1793644481","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5295370\/222afaca38b2e947289c30ac87de97a8a91d35f4\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793644481","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5295370\/222afaca38b2e947289c30ac87de97a8a91d35f4\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793644481","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core, 2 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.3, integrated graphics are enough<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 300 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Training PLC built in, no other software required.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Quad-core<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Vulkan-capable graphics card<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"CODESYS is a trademark of CODESYS GmbH. Baukiste is not affiliated with this company.","developers":["Pausenhof"],"publishers":["Pausenhof"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":1499,"final":1004,"discount_percent":33,"initial_formatted"